{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107719","id":2605181442,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bR-oC","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107719","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107719.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107719.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107719","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107719/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107719/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107719/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9c4b8671e868f0baeb322fc2f842e4b61edeb150","number":107719,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Create dummy thumbnails for scenes that have no visuals","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In PR #102313 thumbnail will not be created if either:\r\n1. Scene is using a ```SubViewport``` class as scene root\r\n2. Scene has no nodes derived from ```Node3D```, ```Node2D```, or ```Control```\r\n\r\nNot generating thumbnails for those scenes also **prevents md5 checksum to be recorded**. Related code:\r\n```c++\r\n// editor/editor_resource_preview.cpp:237\r\n\r\n// Cache the preview in case it's a resource on disk.\r\nif (r_texture.is_valid()) {\r\n        // Wow it generated a preview... save cache.\r\n        ...\r\n```\r\nSome projects could have many scenes that matches those conditions, to stop unnecessary attempts to read the unchanged scene file, we give them a dummy thumbnail instead (so the md5 is stored).\r\n\r\nOther part of code that returns a empty ```Ref<Texture2D>()``` is intended, which means the process is either aborted or failed, and retry is needed.\r\n\r\nFixes #107712","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-19T15:33:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T09:46:09Z","closed_at":"2025-06-21T09:41:33Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1a25152af244e52044b515f85d3c288a3c984cd7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"daniel080400:dummy_thumbnails_for_scene_not_2d3d","ref":"dummy_thumbnails_for_scene_not_2d3d"